From 6fd071905676c7ae8a83ab3ccab56a821d0da093 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:52:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Embed device photos in existing tiles instead of a separate
 gallery
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Removes the "Mina enheter" gallery row and distributes the same photos
across the dashboard's existing cards per Håkan's restructuring request:

- Home Power card: solar panel, battery and Growatt inverter photos as a
  thumbnail stack next to the title.
- Perific One tile: Perific One's own device photo (previously misfiled
  as "ev-charger.jpg" / assumed to be the Zaptec charger - corrected per
  Håkan's explicit feedback). Also absorbs the old "Effektvakt" tile's
  governor status/metrics ("Lägg status för effektvakt i perific rutan").
- New "Zaptec Go 2" tile (replacing the old Effektvakt slot): the actual
  charger's on/off state and current charging power, moved from the old
  EV-laddning tile. Generic icon - no device-specific photo exists since
  that photo turned out to be Perific One's.
- "Elfordon" tile (renamed from "EV-laddning"): EV3 photo, state of
  charge only.
- Nibe tile: F750 photo, plus a new physical-activity status line
  (Varmvatten/Uppvärmning hus/Avfrostning/Inaktiv) derived from the live
  Prio register and a defrost override, separate from the existing
  decision-engine status label shown on the dedicated /nibe page.

v0.1.20.
